Package: eventfreeregistry
Type: Task
Title: Long-Term Event-Free Probability Difference In A Two-Therapy Registry
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("anonymous", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "anonymous")
Description: Working environment for estimating the standardized difference in the
    long-term event-free probability between two therapies in an observational
    oncology registry where uptake is not randomized and a fraction of patients
    never relapse. The registry records live under data and the analyst writes an
    R estimator at /app/analysis.R.
